1-31T01:37:39Z","updated_at":"2014-01-31T01:39:36Z","body":"I have 18 paths at present.  Basically my CMS is designed to be modular, so each module (accounts, content, menu, shop etc) is a plugin.  Each module also has a folder called \"Addons\" which is treated as a plugin path, so that you can do things like adding a special payment library to the accounts module.  However not all plugin paths are valid -- most modules don't actually have an \"Addons\" folder, but if I add one I want plugins to be found within that folder.  This all works quite well for me.  \n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/cakephp/issues/comments/33754713/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"nebbian","id":489642,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4OTY0Mg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/489642?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nebbian","html_url":"https://github.com/nebbian","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nebbian/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nebbian/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nebbian/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nebbian/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nebbian/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nebbian/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nebbian/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nebbian/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nebbian/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/cakephp/issues/comments/33756359","html_url":"https://github.com/cakephp/cakephp/issues/2748#issuecomment-33756359","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/cakephp/issues/